.TH SSCRPCD 8 "September 2026" "qcom-sensors-binaries 1.2.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
sscrpcd \- Qualcomm Sensors DSP RPC daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sscrpcd
.I domain
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sscrpcd
provides the userspace RPC endpoint used to communicate with sensor services
running on the Qualcomm Sensors DSP. The packaged systemd service starts it for
the
.B sensorspd
domain on supported Qualcomm platforms.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sensors
Sensor service configuration and registry metadata.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1)
